{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"layer":"bg","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"x":-500,"mirrow":false,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack","addImg":""},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"layer":"bg","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1.5,"x":-500,"mirrow":false,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack","addImg":""},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"x":290,"mirrow":false,"y":-259,"img":"chara029_1","addImg":"chara029_1_face_chara029_1c"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":290,"mirrow":false,"y":-259,"img":"chara029_1","addImg":"chara029_1_face_chara029_1c"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"安娜","text":"[show]“天灾调律者”啊。大部分人觉得，这只是个听起来唬人的称号罢了。[r]因为在他们眼里，天灾不是研究就能分析透的，是上天的旨意。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"安娜","text":"[show]但在我看来，并非如此。世间万物都有规律，一切都值得研究。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara029_1_face_chara029_1d"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"安娜","text":"[show]不知你有没有注意过，飓风前大气中水元素浓度会剧烈上升；地震前鸟类魔物不愿归巢，水栖魔物会在水域附近闹腾；暴雨来临前，一些昆虫魔物会大规模迁徙？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara029_1_face_chara029_1c"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"安娜","text":"[show]所有灾害都有前兆。前兆意味着其中存在规律和原理。[r]如果搞清这些原理，我们智慧生物是否也能发展出防治灾害，乃至杜绝灾害的技术？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara029_1_face_chara029_1d"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"安娜","text":"[show]有史以来，还从未有人系统研究过这个课题。[r]只是我觉得，由我来迈出这第一步也无妨，仅此而已。看你的表情，你应该很能理解了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"}],"des":"安娜-熟识2","script":"yd_029_05"}